From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:44:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Docs/ABI/damon: update for report producer sysfs files

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 .../ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon         | 38 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 38 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon b/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
index 25f57d5cea731..13e59095cffd1 100644
--- a/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
+++ b/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
@@ -702,3 +702,41 @@ Date:		May 2026
 Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
 Description:	Reading this file returns the number of data-attribute
 		monitoring probe-hit positive samples of the region.
+
+What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/nr_producers
+Date:		Nov 2026
+Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
+Description:	Writing a number 'N' to this file creates the number of
+		directories for controlling each DAMON report producers
+		named '0' to 'N-1' under the 'producers/' directory.
+
+What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/report_type
+Date:		Nov 2026
+Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
+Description:	Writing to and reading from this file sets and gets the type of
+		the reports the producer will generate and submit.
+
+What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/producer_state
+Date:		Nov 2026
+Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
+Description:	Writing 'on' or 'off' to this file makes the report producer be
+		enabled and disabled, respectively.  Writing 'submit' to this
+		file while 'report_type' is 'user_report' makes the producer to
+		generate and submit a report of the type.  Reading from this
+		file gets the enablement state ('on' or 'off').
+
+What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/addr_start
+Date:		Nov 2026
+Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
+Description:	Writing an integer to and reading from this file sets and gets
+		the start address of the report to manually generate and
+		submit, depending on the type of the report producer.  Note
+		that the start address is inclusive.
+
+What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/addr_end
+Date:		Nov 2026
+Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
+Description:	Writing an integer to and reading from this file sets and gets
+		the end address of the report to manually generate and submit,
+		depending on the type of the report producer.  Note that the
+		end address is exclusive.
-- 
2.47.3

